{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>With this he shall enter — a bull, a son of cattle.</b> By consecrating a bull for a sin-offering and a ram for a burnt-offering, and by donning the linen garments that have in them neither color nor woven craftsmanship. For indeed the High Priest does not delay entering the inner sanctuary until after the offering of the burnt-offering, but enters to burn the incense immediately after the slaughter of the sin-offering."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:24.441743933Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}